      "id": "rc_no_recovery_sequential",
      "kind": "root_cause",
      "text": "When sendTokenDelegate fails, the operation reverts and the processing index stays unchanged; since operations process sequentially and the queue has no skip, selective reset, retry, or override mechanism, all subsequent operations become permanently stuck.",
